    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defendrion</strong> is a fast-paced, top-down action RPG where survival is only the beginning. Each level throws you into escalating waves of monsters that test your reflexes, spell-craft, and tactical grit. Slay foes to harvest XP, then shape your destiny on the fly:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Your Arsenal</strong> \u2013 Unlock brand-new elemental spells or evolve existing ones into devastating second-tier forms. Rain chain-lightning across the arena, freeze entire mobs in place, or unleash a swirling black-hole that drags enemies to their doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Firebolt Upgrade \u2013</strong> Each tier adds extra bolts, turning a single shot into a scorching volley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776300/extras/1f8d2c6e593020ee839b7dc15ae8d7c8.poster.avif?t=1755736525\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776300/extras/1f8d2c6e593020ee839b7dc15ae8d7c8.webm?t=1755736525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776300/extras/1f8d2c6e593020ee839b7dc15ae8d7c8.mp4?t=1755736525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Electrocute Upgrade \u2013</strong> Empower the spell so its lightning chains through even more enemies with every cast.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776300/extras/96803739e3e83dcda26891e9b26487c3.poster.avif?t=1755736525\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776300/extras/96803739e3e83dcda26891e9b26487c3.webm?t=1755736525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776300/extras/96803739e3e83dcda26891e9b26487c3.mp4?t=1755736525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Your Build</strong> \u2013 Level-ups grant attribute points you can drop into Power, Resilience, Crit Chance, and more. Lean into glass-cannon burst damage, become an unbreakable bulwark, or craft a balanced battlemage\u2014every run can feel different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Wave System</strong> \u2013 Clear a wave, breathe for half a heartbeat, and the next horde spawns in with new enemy types, patterns, and elite minibosses that demand fresh tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression That Sticks</strong> \u2013 Conquer a level and push deeper into the realm. Harder arenas yield rarer spell mods, unique buffs, and brag-worthy leaderboard scores, rewarding both skillful dodging and strategic build choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick-Up-and-Play, Tough-to-Master</strong> \u2013 Tight controls, snappy twin-stick combat, and bite-sized stages keep the action flowing, while layered synergies and high-score chasing give hardcore players plenty to min-max.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defendrion is all about that addictive loop: enter, annihilate, evolve, and dive straight into the next, deadlier gauntlet. How long can you hold the line?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defendrion</strong> is a fast-paced, top-down action RPG where survival is only the beginning. Each level throws you into escalating waves of monsters that test your reflexes, spell-craft, and tactical grit. Slay foes to harvest XP, then shape your destiny on the fly:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Your Arsenal</strong> \u2013 Unlock brand-new elemental spells or evolve existing ones into devastating second-tier forms. Rain chain-lightning across the arena, freeze entire mobs in place, or unleash a swirling black-hole that drags enemies to their doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Firebolt Upgrade \u2013</strong> Each tier adds extra bolts, turning a single shot into a scorching volley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776300/extras/1f8d2c6e593020ee839b7dc15ae8d7c8.poster.avif?t=1755736525\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776300/extras/1f8d2c6e593020ee839b7dc15ae8d7c8.webm?t=1755736525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776300/extras/1f8d2c6e593020ee839b7dc15ae8d7c8.mp4?t=1755736525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Electrocute Upgrade \u2013</strong> Empower the spell so its lightning chains through even more enemies with every cast.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776300/extras/96803739e3e83dcda26891e9b26487c3.poster.avif?t=1755736525\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776300/extras/96803739e3e83dcda26891e9b26487c3.webm?t=1755736525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776300/extras/96803739e3e83dcda26891e9b26487c3.mp4?t=1755736525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Your Build</strong> \u2013 Level-ups grant attribute points you can drop into Power, Resilience, Crit Chance, and more. Lean into glass-cannon burst damage, become an unbreakable bulwark, or craft a balanced battlemage\u2014every run can feel different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Wave System</strong> \u2013 Clear a wave, breathe for half a heartbeat, and the next horde spawns in with new enemy types, patterns, and elite minibosses that demand fresh tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression That Sticks</strong> \u2013 Conquer a level and push deeper into the realm. Harder arenas yield rarer spell mods, unique buffs, and brag-worthy leaderboard scores, rewarding both skillful dodging and strategic build choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick-Up-and-Play, Tough-to-Master</strong> \u2013 Tight controls, snappy twin-stick combat, and bite-sized stages keep the action flowing, while layered synergies and high-score chasing give hardcore players plenty to min-max.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defendrion is all about that addictive loop: enter, annihilate, evolve, and dive straight into the next, deadlier gauntlet. How long can you hold the line?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
